<!-- Section 2: Documentation Technique -->
<h1>2. Documentation Technique</h1>

<!-- 2.a Diagramme d'Architecture -->
<h2>a. Diagramme d'Architecture (Services + Communication)</h2>

<h3>Vue d'ensemble de l'Architecture Microservices</h3>

<p>Le projet EventFlow est base sur une architecture microservices composee de plusieurs services independants qui communiquent entre eux via des API REST et des clients Feign.</p>

<h4>Services de l'Infrastructure</h4>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Service</th>
        <th>Port</th>
        <th>Role</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Config Server</strong></td>
        <td>8888</td>
        <td>Centralisation de la configuration (Git Repository)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Eureka Server</strong></td>
        <td>8761</td>
        <td>Service Discovery - Enregistrement et decouverte des services</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>API Gateway</strong></td>
        <td>1111</td>
        <td>Point d'entree unique, routage, authentification JWT, CORS</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h4>Services Metier</h4>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Service</th>
        <th>Port</th>
        <th>Responsabilites</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>User Service</strong></td>
        <td>7020</td>
        <td>Authentification, gestion des utilisateurs, JWT, securite</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Event Service</strong></td>
        <td>9030</td>
        <td>Gestion des evenements, inscriptions, Circuit Breaker</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Campaign Service</strong></td>
        <td>9020</td>
        <td>Gestion des campagnes marketing, segments cibles</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Notification Service</strong></td>
        <td>7010</td>
        <td>Envoi d'emails, notifications, traitement batch</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Analytics Service</strong></td>
        <td>9010</td>
        <td>Calcul et stockage des metriques, statistiques</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h4>Frontend</h4>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Application</th>
        <th>Port</th>
        <th>Technologies</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Angular Frontend</strong></td>
        <td>4200</td>
        <td>Angular 17+, TypeScript, RxJS, Standalone Components</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h3>Schema d'Architecture</h3>

<div class="code-block">
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                    FRONTEND                                        |
|                              Angular (Port 4200)                                   |
+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------+
                                      | HTTP/REST
                                      v
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                           API GATEWAY (Reactive Gateway)                           |
|                                   Port: 1111                                       |
|   +----------------+  +----------------+  +----------------+                       |
|   |  JWT Filter    |  |  CORS Config   |  |  Load Balancer |                       |
|   |  (Validation)  |  |  (Global)      |  |  (lb://)       |                       |
|   +----------------+  +----------------+  +----------------+                       |
+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------+
                                      |
        +-----------------------------+-----------------------------+
        |                             |                             |
        v                             v                             v
+---------------+            +---------------+            +---------------+
| CONFIG SERVER |            | EUREKA SERVER |            |   SERVICES    |
|   Port: 8888  |<---------->|   Port: 8761  |<---------->|   (Metier)    |
|   (Git Repo)  |            | (Discovery)   |            |               |
+---------------+            +---------------+            +---------------+
                                                                  |
        +-----------+-----------+-----------+------------+--------+--------+
        |           |           |           |            |                 |
        v           v           v           v            v                 v
+----------+ +----------+ +----------+ +----------+ +----------+
|   USER   | |  EVENT   | | CAMPAIGN | |NOTIFICA- | | ANALYTICS|
| SERVICE  | | SERVICE  | | SERVICE  | |  TION    | | SERVICE  |
|Port:7020 | |Port:9030 | |Port:9020 | |Port:7010 | |Port:9010 |
+----------+ +----------+ +----------+ +----------+ +----------+
</div>

<h3>Communication Inter-Services (Feign Clients)</h3>

<p>Les services communiquent entre eux via des clients Feign pour effectuer des operations transversales :</p>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Service Source</th>
        <th>Service Cible</th>
        <th>Utilisation</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>User Service</td>
        <td>Notification Service</td>
        <td>Notification de bienvenue lors de l'inscription</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>Event Service</td>
        <td>User Service</td>
        <td>Validation de l'organisateur et des participants</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>Event Service</td>
        <td>Notification Service</td>
        <td>Confirmation d'inscription aux evenements</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>Campaign Service</td>
        <td>User Service</td>
        <td>Validation de l'organisateur de campagne</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>Analytics Service</td>
        <td>Event Service</td>
        <td>Recuperation des donnees evenements pour metriques</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>Analytics Service</td>
        <td>Campaign Service</td>
        <td>Recuperation des donnees campagnes pour metriques</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>Notification Service</td>
        <td>User Service</td>
        <td>Validation du destinataire de notification</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<div class="page-break"></div>

<!-- 2.b Description des Endpoints -->
<h2>b. Description des Endpoints Principaux</h2>

<h3>1. User Service - /api/users (Port 7020)</h3>

<p>Service responsable de l'authentification et de la gestion des utilisateurs.</p>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Methode</th>
        <th>Endpoint</th>
        <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">POST</span></td>
        <td>/api/users/login</td>
        <td>Authentification utilisateur (retourne un token JWT)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">POST</span></td>
        <td>/api/users/register</td>
        <td>Inscription d'un nouvel utilisateur</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/users</td>
        <td>Liste tous les utilisateurs</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/users/{id}</td>
        <td>Recupere un utilisateur par son ID</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/users/email/{email}</td>
        <td>Recupere un utilisateur par son email</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">POST</span></td>
        <td>/api/users</td>
        <td>Cree un nouvel utilisateur</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">PUT</span></td>
        <td>/api/users/{id}</td>
        <td>Met a jour un utilisateur existant</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">DELETE</span></td>
        <td>/api/users/{id}</td>
        <td>Supprime un utilisateur</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">PATCH</span></td>
        <td>/api/users/{id}/last-login</td>
        <td>Met a jour la date de derniere connexion</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h3>2. Event Service - /api/events (Port 9030)</h3>

<p>Service de gestion des evenements avec support Circuit Breaker (Resilience4j).</p>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Methode</th>
        <th>Endpoint</th>
        <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/events</td>
        <td>Liste tous les evenements (avec Circuit Breaker)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/events/{id}</td>
        <td>Recupere un evenement par son ID</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/events/organizer/{organizerId}</td>
        <td>Evenements par organisateur</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/events/status/{status}</td>
        <td>Evenements par statut</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">POST</span></td>
        <td>/api/events</td>
        <td>Cree un nouvel evenement</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">PUT</span></td>
        <td>/api/events/{id}</td>
        <td>Met a jour un evenement</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">PATCH</span></td>
        <td>/api/events/{id}/close</td>
        <td>Cloture un evenement</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">DELETE</span></td>
        <td>/api/events/{id}</td>
        <td>Supprime un evenement</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h4>Endpoints d'Inscription aux Evenements</h4>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Methode</th>
        <th>Endpoint</th>
        <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/events/registrations</td>
        <td>Liste toutes les inscriptions</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/events/registrations/event/{eventId}</td>
        <td>Inscriptions par evenement</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/events/registrations/user/{userId}</td>
        <td>Inscriptions par utilisateur</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">POST</span></td>
        <td>/api/events/registrations/event/{eventId}/user/{userId}</td>
        <td>Inscrire un utilisateur a un evenement</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">DELETE</span></td>
        <td>/api/events/registrations/{id}</td>
        <td>Supprimer une inscription</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h3>3. Campaign Service - /api/campaigns (Port 9020)</h3>

<p>Service de gestion des campagnes marketing.</p>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Methode</th>
        <th>Endpoint</th>
        <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/campaigns</td>
        <td>Liste toutes les campagnes</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/campaigns/{id}</td>
        <td>Recupere une campagne par ID</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/campaigns/organizer/{organizerId}</td>
        <td>Campagnes par organisateur</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/campaigns/status/{status}</td>
        <td>Campagnes par statut</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">POST</span></td>
        <td>/api/campaigns</td>
        <td>Cree une nouvelle campagne</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">PUT</span></td>
        <td>/api/campaigns/{id}</td>
        <td>Met a jour une campagne</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">PATCH</span></td>
        <td>/api/campaigns/{id}/status/{status}</td>
        <td>Change le statut d'une campagne</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">DELETE</span></td>
        <td>/api/campaigns/{id}</td>
        <td>Supprime une campagne</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h3>4. Notification Service - /api/notifications (Port 7010)</h3>

<p>Service de gestion des notifications avec support batch et envoi d'emails.</p>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Methode</th>
        <th>Endpoint</th>
        <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/notifications</td>
        <td>Liste toutes les notifications (avec Circuit Breaker)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/notifications/{id}</td>
        <td>Recupere une notification par ID</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/notifications/status/{status}</td>
        <td>Notifications par statut</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">GET</span></td>
        <td>/api/notifications/recipient/{recipientId}</td>
        <td>Notifications par destinataire</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">POST</span></td>
        <td>/api/notifications</td>
        <td>Cree une notification</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">POST</span></td>
        <td>/api/notifications/from-map</td>
        <td>Cree notification (format Map pour Feign)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">PUT</span></td>
        <td>/api/notifications/{id}</td>
        <td>Met a jour une notification</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">PATCH</span></td>
        <td>/api/notifications/{id}/status/{status}</td>
        <td>Change le statut</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><span class="highlight">DELETE</span></td>
        <td>/api/notifications/{id}</td>
        <td>Supprime une notification</td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="background-color: #e7f3ff;">
        <td><span class="highlight">POST</span></td>
        <td><strong>/api/notifications/batch/process</strong></td>
        <td><strong>Declenche le job batch de traitement</strong></td>
    </tr>
</table>

