<!-- 2.c Diagramme de Sequence -->
<h2>c. Diagramme de Sequence - Inscription a un Evenement</h2>

<p>Ce diagramme illustre le flux complet d'inscription d'un utilisateur a un evenement, incluant la validation, la creation de l'inscription et l'envoi de la notification de confirmation.</p>

<h3>Description du Flux</h3>

<div class="code-block">
+----------+     +---------+     +-------------+     +------------+     +------------------+
| Frontend |     | Gateway |     |EventService |     |UserService |     |NotificationService|
+----+-----+     +----+----+     +------+------+     +-----+------+     +--------+---------+
     |                |                 |                  |                     |
     | 1. POST /api/events/registrations/event/{eventId}/user/{userId}           |
     |---------------->                 |                  |                     |
     |                |                 |                  |                     |
     |                | 2. Valide JWT   |                  |                     |
     |                | & Route request |                  |                     |
     |                |---------------->|                  |                     |
     |                |                 |                  |                     |
     |                |                 | 3. GET /api/users/{userId}             |
     |                |                 |  (Feign Client)  |                     |
     |                |                 |----------------->|                     |
     |                |                 |                  |                     |
     |                |                 | 4. Return User   |                     |
     |                |                 |<-----------------|                     |
     |                |                 |                  |                     |
     |                |                 | 5. Verifie:                            |
     |                |                 |    - Event existe                      |
     |                |                 |    - Capacite disponible               |
     |                |                 |    - User pas deja inscrit             |
     |                |                 |                  |                     |
     |                |                 | 6. Cree Registration                   |
     |                |                 |    & Update currentParticipants        |
     |                |                 |                  |                     |
     |                |                 | 7. POST /api/notifications/from-map    |
     |                |                 |  (Feign - Notification de confirmation)|
     |                |                 |-------------------------------------->|
     |                |                 |                  |                     |
     |                |                 |                  |    8. Cree Notif    |
     |                |                 |                  |    & Envoie Email   |
     |                |                 |                  |                     |
     |                |                 | 9. Return Notif  |                     |
     |                |                 |<--------------------------------------|
     |                |                 |                  |                     |
     |                | 10. Return Registration            |                     |
     |                |<----------------|                  |                     |
     |                |                 |                  |                     |
     | 11. 200 OK + Registration data   |                  |                     |
     |<----------------|                 |                  |                     |
     |                |                 |                  |                     |
</div>

<h3>Etapes Detaillees</h3>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Etape</th>
        <th>Action</th>
        <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>Requete Frontend</td>
        <td>L'utilisateur clique sur "S'inscrire" dans l'interface Angular</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>2</td>
        <td>Validation Gateway</td>
        <td>Le Gateway valide le token JWT et route vers EventService</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>3-4</td>
        <td>Validation Utilisateur</td>
        <td>EventService appelle UserService via Feign pour valider l'existence de l'utilisateur</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>5</td>
        <td>Verifications Metier</td>
        <td>Verifie que l'evenement existe, a de la capacite, et que l'utilisateur n'est pas deja inscrit</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>6</td>
        <td>Creation Inscription</td>
        <td>Cree l'inscription en base et incremente le compteur de participants</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>7-9</td>
        <td>Notification</td>
        <td>Appelle NotificationService pour creer et envoyer un email de confirmation</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>10-11</td>
        <td>Reponse</td>
        <td>Retourne les donnees d'inscription au frontend</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<div class="page-break"></div>

<!-- 2.d Documentation Batch et Notifications -->
<h2>d. Documentation du Batch et du Systeme de Notifications</h2>

<h3>Systeme de Notifications</h3>

<h4>Architecture du Service</h4>

<div class="code-block">
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                     NOTIFICATION SERVICE (Port 7010)                     |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                         |
|  +----------------+    +----------------+    +----------------+          |
|  |  Controller    |    |  Service       |    |  Repository    |          |
|  |  (REST API)    |--->|  (Logique)     |--->|  (JPA/DB)      |          |
|  +----------------+    +-------+--------+    +----------------+          |
|                                |                                         |
|                                v                                         |
|                        +----------------+                                |
|                        |  EmailService  |                                |
|                        |  (SMTP/Gmail)  |                                |
|                        +----------------+                                |
|                                                                         |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------+      |
|  |                    SPRING BATCH                                |      |
|  |  +----------+    +--------------+    +--------------+          |      |
|  |  |  Reader  |--->|  Processor   |--->|   Writer     |          |      |
|  |  | (PENDING)|    | (Send Email) |    | (Save DB)    |          |      |
|  |  +----------+    +--------------+    +--------------+          |      |
|  +---------------------------------------------------------------+      |
|                                                                         |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
</div>

<h4>Types de Notifications</h4>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Type</th>
        <th>Description</th>
        <th>Declencheur</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>WELCOME</strong></td>
        <td>Message de bienvenue</td>
        <td>Inscription d'un nouvel utilisateur</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>EVENT_REGISTRATION</strong></td>
        <td>Confirmation d'inscription</td>
        <td>Inscription a un evenement</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>EVENT_REMINDER</strong></td>
        <td>Rappel d'evenement</td>
        <td>Batch planifie (avant evenement)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>CAMPAIGN_UPDATE</strong></td>
        <td>Mise a jour de campagne</td>
        <td>Modification d'une campagne</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>SYSTEM_ALERT</strong></td>
        <td>Alerte systeme</td>
        <td>Erreurs ou maintenance</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h4>Canaux de Notification</h4>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Canal</th>
        <th>Implementation</th>
        <th>Statut</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>EMAIL</strong></td>
        <td>SMTP via JavaMailSender (Gmail)</td>
        <td>Operationnel</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>SMS</strong></td>
        <td>Simule (pret pour integration Twilio)</td>
        <td>Simule</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>PUSH</strong></td>
        <td>Simule (pret pour integration Firebase)</td>
        <td>Simule</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>IN_APP</strong></td>
        <td>Stocke en base pour affichage</td>
        <td>Operationnel</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h4>Statuts des Notifications</h4>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Statut</th>
        <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>PENDING</strong></td>
        <td>En attente d'envoi</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>SENT</strong></td>
        <td>Envoyee avec succes</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>FAILED</strong></td>
        <td>Echec apres 3 tentatives</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>READ</strong></td>
        <td>Lue par le destinataire</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h3>Systeme Batch (Spring Batch)</h3>

<h4>Configuration</h4>

<div class="code-block">
# application.properties - Notification Service

# Desactive le demarrage automatique des jobs
spring.batch.job.enabled=false

# Initialise le schema batch en base
spring.batch.jdbc.initialize-schema=always

# Configuration Email (Gmail SMTP)
spring.mail.host=smtp.gmail.com
spring.mail.port=587
spring.mail.username=chakourimad01@gmail.com
spring.mail.password=${MAIL_PASSWORD}
spring.mail.properties.mail.smtp.auth=true
spring.mail.properties.mail.smtp.starttls.enable=true
</div>

<h4>Architecture du Job Batch</h4>

<div class="info-box">
<strong>Job:</strong> processNotificationJob<br>
<strong>Step:</strong> processNotificationStep (chunk size = 10)
</div>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Composant</th>
        <th>Role</th>
        <th>Configuration</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>ItemReader</strong></td>
        <td>Lit les notifications en statut PENDING</td>
        <td>Page size = 100, Tri par ID ascendant</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>ItemProcessor</strong></td>
        <td>Traite chaque notification (envoi email)</td>
        <td>Retry count max = 3</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>ItemWriter</strong></td>
        <td>Sauvegarde les notifications traitees</td>
        <td>Chunk size = 10</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h4>Flux de Traitement du Batch</h4>

<div class="code-block">
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                    processNotificationJob                          |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                   |
|   +-----------------------------------------------------------+   |
|   |                  processNotificationStep                   |   |
|   |                    (chunk size = 10)                       |   |
|   +-----------------------------------------------------------+   |
|   |                                                            |   |
|   |  +----------------+                                        |   |
|   |  |   ItemReader   |  - Lit les notifications PENDING       |   |
|   |  |                |  - Page size = 100                     |   |
|   |  |                |  - Tri par ID ascendant                |   |
|   |  +-------+--------+                                        |   |
|   |          |                                                 |   |
|   |          v                                                 |   |
|   |  +----------------+                                        |   |
|   |  | ItemProcessor  |  - Pour canal EMAIL:                   |   |
|   |  |                |    * Appelle EmailService.sendEmail()  |   |
|   |  |                |    * Si succes: status = SENT          |   |
|   |  |                |    * Si echec: retryCount++            |   |
|   |  |                |    * Si retryCount >= 3: FAILED        |   |
|   |  |                |  - Pour autres canaux:                 |   |
|   |  |                |    * Simule l'envoi, status = SENT     |   |
|   |  +-------+--------+                                        |   |
|   |          |                                                 |   |
|   |          v                                                 |   |
|   |  +----------------+                                        |   |
|   |  |  ItemWriter    |  - Sauvegarde les notifications        |   |
|   |  |                |  - Met a jour sentDate, deliveryStatus |   |
|   |  +----------------+                                        |   |
|   |                                                            |   |
|   +-----------------------------------------------------------+   |
|                                                                   |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
</div>

<h4>Declenchement du Batch</h4>

<p>Le job batch peut etre declenche manuellement via l'API REST :</p>

<div class="code-block">
# Requete
POST http://localhost:1111/api/notifications/batch/process

# Reponse succes
{
  "status": "success",
  "message": "Batch job 'processNotificationJob' has been triggered successfully"
}

# Reponse erreur
{
  "status": "error",
  "message": "Failed to trigger batch job: [message d'erreur]"
}
</div>

<h4>Flux d'Execution Detaille</h4>

<ol>
    <li><strong>Declenchement</strong> : Appel POST /api/notifications/batch/process</li>
    <li><strong>Lecture</strong> : ItemReader recupere les notifications PENDING (100 par page)</li>
    <li><strong>Traitement</strong> : ItemProcessor envoie les emails (par lots de 10)</li>
    <li><strong>Ecriture</strong> : ItemWriter sauvegarde les statuts mis a jour</li>
    <li><strong>Retry</strong> : Les notifications en echec sont retraitees (max 3 fois)</li>
</ol>

<div class="warning-box">
<strong>Note importante :</strong> Pour utiliser l'envoi d'emails via Gmail, vous devez configurer un "Mot de passe d'application" (16 caracteres) et non pas votre mot de passe Gmail standard. L'authentification a deux facteurs doit etre activee sur votre compte Google.
</div>

